{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "154f3875-833e-884e-9a1c-0bd3b12e0fb7",
  "created_at": "2026-02-02T15:33:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Janice Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T15:31:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T15:31:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. Um, I am wanting to build a fence, a privacy fence. My neighbor, he built a new deck, and now it is looking right down into my yard. Everybody can see me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T15:31:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no fun. Okay, so a fence. What kind of fence are you thinking about, and how tall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T15:31:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wood, the pressure-treated wood. And tall, um, whatever is allowed. As tall as they let me. [pause] Sorry, there is a noise on my phone, like, like frying bacon. You can hear it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T15:31:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do hear a little crackle, but I can understand you fine. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T15:32:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. So my question is, do I need a permit for the fence? Or I just build it? I am not understanding how it works here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T15:32:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In general, yes, a fence usually does need a permit, and the height is one of the things that matters. So you'd want to apply before you buy lumber or start digging."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T15:32:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, before. Okay. I thought maybe only for the big one, the tall one. So even a small one, also a permit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T15:32:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Best to assume yes and check with us first. Anything else on your mind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T15:32:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one more. The finished side, the nice side, it must face out? To the neighbor? Or to me? I am not sure which is the front, the back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T15:32:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a common question. Typically the finished side faces outward, toward the neighbor, but the permit staff can confirm the rule for you when you apply. I can take your name and number and have someone call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T15:32:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Janice Brownell. The number is 401-555-0172."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T15:32:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Janice. Someone will call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T15:32:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, you are very kind. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
